title: Start
---
Oh... Another one. Sleeping Beauty decides to roll outta the dirt. Took you long enough. #line:StartDialog_001
You okay? No? Good. Welcome to the forest, not just your average collection of trees, oh no... This one's got thoughts. Feelings. Maybe even a superiority complex. #line:StartDialog_002
Honestly? It’s smarter than you. But don’t take it personally. Most rocks are, too. #line:StartDialog_003
... #line:StartDialog_004
I know what you’re thinking. “A crab? In a forest?” #line:StartDialog_005
I know what you’re thinking. “A crab? In a forest?” #line:StartDialog_006
Yeah, genius. A crab. Walking, talking, and mildly judgmental. But hey — I’m not the one who passed out in sentient shrubbery wearing yesterday’s trauma. That’s a you problem. #line:StartDialog_007
... #line:StartDialog_008
You should try escaping. Assuming you like living. Or whatever it is you humans call your half-conscious flailing. #line:StartDialog_009
But don’t get cozy. This place? It... adapts. Warps. Chews up people like you and spits out something with too many eyes. #line:StartDialog_010
Anyway! I’ll be around. Lurking. Judging. You know. Like family. #line:StartDialog_011
===
